    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive fast, weave through traffic, and slam into busy intersections to create a chain reaction of chaos and destruction.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create as much damage as possible before time runs out. Unlock the next level by scoring enough to achieve a bronze medal. Grab pickups for a score multiplier, boost, or to explode your vehicle and cause maximum damage.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive fast, weave through traffic, and slam into busy intersections to create a chain reaction of chaos and destruction.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create as much damage as possible before time runs out. Unlock the next level by scoring enough to achieve a bronze medal. Grab pickups for a score multiplier, boost, or to explode your vehicle and cause maximum damage.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
